# Generated macro build output — upstream's `outputs` rule above only
# matches a literally-named "outputs" dir, not the per-config dirs/.ok
# stamps `make` actually creates under macros/ (named after each config in
# macros/{rom,sram}_configs/). Add an entry per config as you build it.
macros/sky130_rom_1kbyte/
macros/*.ok
